<html><head><title>Are you stuck?</title>
<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"></head><body><h1 style="margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; line-height: 1.4; font-size: 32px;"><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px;">Every </span><span style="margin: 0px;">transdisciplinary</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> project </span><span style="margin: 0px;">reaches</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> a moment </span><span style="margin: 0px;">when</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> </span><span style="margin: 0px;">doubt</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> sets in, </span><span style="margin: 0px;">frustration</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> </span><span style="margin: 0px;">rises</span><span style="margin: 0px;">, </span><span style="margin: 0px;">and</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> </span><span style="margin: 0px;">the</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> </span><span style="margin: 0px;">guiding</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> </span><span style="margin: 0px;">vision</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> </span><span style="margin: 0px;">seems</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> lost. </span><span style="margin: 0px;">This</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> is </span><span style="margin: 0px;">sometimes</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> </span><span style="margin: 0px;">referred</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> </span><span style="margin: 0px;">to</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> as </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;"><span style="margin: 0px">“Blue </span><span style="margin: 0px">Monday</span><span style="margin: 0px">.”</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><font color="#000000"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span><span style="margin: 0px">If</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">you’ve</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">reached</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">that</span><span style="margin: 0px"> point, </span><span style="margin: 0px">you</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">can</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">use</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">following</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">questions</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">and</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">exercises</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">to</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">regain perspective.</span></font></span></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">Under </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;"><span style="margin: 0px">practice</span><span style="margin: 0px"> tab</span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">, </span><span style="margin: 0px">you’ll</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">find</span><span style="margin: 0px"> a series of </span><span style="margin: 0px">questions</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">and</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">assignments</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">designed</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">to</span><span style="margin: 0px"> help </span><span style="margin: 0px">you</span><span style="margin: 0px"> get back on track, </span><span style="margin: 0px">based</span><span style="margin: 0px"> on a card game </span><span style="margin: 0px">by</span><span style="margin: 0px"> Ankie Schoemakers, </span><span style="margin: 0px">adapted</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">by</span><span style="margin: 0px"> Meike Koop (</span><span style="margin: 0px">from</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-style: italic; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">Mind </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> Gap</span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px"> research </span><span style="margin: 0px">group</span><span style="margin: 0px"> at </span><span style="margin: 0px">Avans</span><span style="margin: 0px"> University of </span><span style="margin: 0px">Applied</span><span style="margin: 0px"> Sciences, led </span><span style="margin: 0px">by</span><span style="margin: 0px"> Henk Spies).</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div></h1></body></html>